    {
      "key": "stable_dialogs_escape:escape_trader_jobs_5111#1",
      "source_table": "stable_dialogs_escape",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\stable_dialogs_escape.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 1195,
      "string_id": "escape_trader_jobs_5111",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "I'll try.",
      "JA_current": "やってみる。",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
        {
          "dialog_id": "escape_trader_jobs",
          "phrase_id": "5111",
          "graph_source": "gamedata/config/gameplay/dialogs_escape.xml"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "stable_dialogs_escape:escape_trader_jobs_52#1",
      "source_table": "stable_dialogs_escape",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\stable_dialogs_escape.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 1201,
      "string_id": "escape_trader_jobs_52",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "No, I can't take it on yet.",
      "JA_current": "いや、まだその仕事は引き受けられない。",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
        {
          "dialog_id": "escape_trader_jobs",
          "phrase_id": "52",
          "graph_source": "gamedata/config/gameplay/dialogs_escape.xml"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "stable_dialogs_escape:escape_trader_jobs_61111#1",
      "source_table": "stable_dialogs_escape",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\stable_dialogs_escape.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 1219,
      "string_id": "escape_trader_jobs_61111",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "Alright, listen... You mean business, I can see that... And I... I mean, we need guys like you. We're doing sort of an investigation with some other traders. We want to open up the path to the North, to the center of the Zone. And near the center someone or something is trying to hamper our progress... How the heck this Strelok managed to sneak through, I don't know... You see, there's this one area where your brain starts boiling. An eerie place... Anyway, to cut a long story short - a couple of guys have been spying on them grunts for me, not far from here. Apparently, the ones at the Agroprom Research Institute, have dug up something. Something major. I'm positive it has something to do with the center of the Zone. Anyway, whatever they've dug up, it's secured somewhere on the third floor of the Institute. And we really need this stuff. You see what I mean?",
      "JA_current": "よし、いいか……お前さんが本気だってことは分かった……そして俺は……いや、俺たちにはお前さんみたいな骨のある男が必要なんだ。実は他の商人連中と組んで、ちょっとした調査を進めていてな。ゾーンの中心、北部へと抜けるルートを切り拓きたいんだ。だが中心近くで、誰か……あるいは何かが、俺たちの行く手を阻んでやがる……あのストレロク野郎がどうやってそこを突破したのか、見当もつかんよ……脳ミソが沸騰しちまうような場所があるんだ。不気味なところでな……手短に話そう。ここからそう遠くない場所で、兵隊どもの動向を探らせている仲間が二人いる。どうやらアフロプロム研究所の連中が、何かを掘り当てたらしいんだ。とんでもない大物をな。ゾーンの中心部に直結する代物だと俺は睨んでる。とにかく、掘り出されたブツは研究所の三階のどこかに保管されてる。俺たちはそれが喉から手が出るほど欲しいんだ。言いたいことは分かるな？",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
        {
          "dialog_id": "escape_trader_jobs",
          "phrase_id": "61111",
          "graph_source": "gamedata/config/gameplay/dialogs_escape.xml"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "stable_dialogs_escape:escape_trader_jobs_51111#1",
      "source_table": "stable_dialogs_escape",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\stable_dialogs_escape.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 1198,
      "string_id": "escape_trader_jobs_51111",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "I'll get the cash ready - you haven't let me down once. Just one other thing... keep it low profile. If the military gets pissed off we're all in for a lot of trouble.",
      "JA_current": "報酬を用意して待ってるぞ。お前さんは一度だって俺の期待を裏切ったことがないからな。あと一つだけ……目立たないように動けよ。軍を本気で怒らせたら、俺たち全員まとめてタダじゃ済まないからな。",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
        {
          "dialog_id": "escape_trader_jobs",
          "phrase_id": "51111",
          "graph_source": "gamedata/config/gameplay/dialogs_escape.xml"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "stable_dialogs_escape:escape_trader_jobs_521#1",
      "source_table": "stable_dialogs_escape",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\stable_dialogs_escape.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 1204,
      "string_id": "escape_trader_jobs_521",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "C'mon man, it's not as bad as it sounds. A bunch of drunk recruits green as grass with a single NCO...Well, OK, but I was really counting on you, Marked One...",
      "JA_current": "おいおい頼むよ、聞いたほど無茶な話じゃないって。酒に酔い潰れた青二才の新兵どもと、下士官が一人いるだけだ……まあいいさ、お前さんを頼りにしてたんだがな、マークド・ワン……",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
        {
          "dialog_id": "escape_trader_jobs",
          "phrase_id": "521",
          "graph_source": "gamedata/config/gameplay/dialogs_escape.xml"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "stable_dialogs_escape:escape_trader_jobs_611111#1",
      "source_table": "stable_dialogs_escape",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\stable_dialogs_escape.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 1222,
      "string_id": "escape_trader_jobs_611111",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "I think so.",
      "JA_current": "分かった。",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
        {
          "dialog_id": "escape_trader_jobs",
          "phrase_id": "611111",
          "graph_source": "gamedata/config/gameplay/dialogs_escape.xml"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "stable_dialogs_escape:escape_trader_jobs_6111111#1",
      "source_table": "stable_dialogs_escape",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\stable_dialogs_escape.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 1225,
      "string_id": "escape_trader_jobs_6111111",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "Once you have the documents, don't bring them here. Take them straight to the Barman. He runs the stalker bar, the 100 Rads, I'll upload the coordinates and all the data you need to your PDA. Clear?",
      "JA_current": "書類を手に入れても、ここには持ってくるなよ。バーキープのところへ直行しろ。奴はストーカー御用達の酒場「100レントゲン」を取り仕切ってる。座標と必要なデータはお前のPDAに転送しておく。いいな？",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
        {
          "dialog_id": "escape_trader_jobs",
          "phrase_id": "6111111",
          "graph_source": "gamedata/config/gameplay/dialogs_escape.xml"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "stable_dialogs_escape:escape_trader_jobs_61111111#1",
      "source_table": "stable_dialogs_escape",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\stable_dialogs_escape.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 1228,
      "string_id": "escape_trader_jobs_61111111",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "Gotcha.",
      "JA_current": "了解した。",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
        {
          "dialog_id": "escape_trader_jobs",
          "phrase_id": "61111111",
