      ],
      "speaker_hint": "npc",
      "speaker_hint_basis": "character_binding_and_link_parity",
      "EN": "What special missions? You haven't even finished the last one!",
      "JA_current": "特別任務だと？ お前は今の任務すら満足にできねぇのか！",
