      "speaker_hint": "npc",
      "speaker_hint_basis": "character_binding_and_link_parity",
      "EN": "Listen, Marked One... I've done some thinking, and here's what I'd like to offer... Generally speaking, what you really need is to find Strelok. Right?",
      "JA_current": "よく聞きな… 俺は色々考えてみたのさ。で、お前さんに「頼み事」ができた。今まで話した限りだと、お前さんは Strelok を見つけたい、そうだろう？",
