      "speaker_hint": "npc",
      "speaker_hint_basis": "character_binding_and_link_parity",
      "EN": "Well, here's the deal... A box containing the reports made by an expedition that went deep North into the Zone has been taken to the army outpost. By day, it's guarded as if it was filled with pure plutonium, but for some reason at night they only leave two guards.",
      "JA_current": "さて、ひとつ取引がある… 北方深くゾーンの中まで踏み込んだ遠征隊が作成した報告書、そいつの入った箱を軍の前哨へ持ってかれちまった。日中は、純粋なプルトニウムで満たされるかのように用心深いのだが、ある理由で夜は、2人の見張りしか出てこない。",
      "string_entry_candidates": [
        "stable_dialogs_escape:escape_trader_jobs_5#1"
